---
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<aside class="card" aria-labelledby="questions-label">
  <div class="label" id="questions-label">What buyers ask AI · what your site never says</div>
  <ul class="questions">
    <li>“How do you compare to {site.competitor}?”</li>
    <li>“Who is this <em>not</em> a fit for?”</li>
    <li>“Why does it cost what it costs?”</li>
    <li>“What goes wrong in implementation?”</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">Your reps answer these every day. AI tools can’t, until it’s written down.</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .card {
    flex: 1 1 360px;
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-frame);
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .questions {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .questions li {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 19px;
  }
  .questions li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--clay-light);
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
